    {
      "premise_index": 4,
      "exact_statement": "For every proper curve X over a field k, every invertible sheaf M on X, and every field extension k'/k, deg_{k'}(M_{k'})=deg_k(M). Clearing denominators gives the same equality for actual rational line bundles.",
